@baseUrl = http://localhost:5090
@hauptbahnhof = 60501720

### Hot station: 100 virtual people crowd Hauptbahnhof. Watch the stop grain on the Orleans Dashboard.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/scenario/pinned/{{hauptbahnhof}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "people": 100 }

### Check it: 100 pinned at Hauptbahnhof
GET {{baseUrl}}/scenario
Accept: application/json

### Reset: everybody goes back to the random behaviour
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/scenario/pinned
